      "'enum' lists strings (type string) or integers (type integer).",
      "'pattern' is an ECMA-262 / Python-compatible regular expression anchored with ^...$.",
      "integer accepts JSON integers only (true/false and 5.0 are rejected); number accepts integers and finite decimals; boolean accepts true/false only.",
